{ 202. Andranik Matikozian – Rustam Kasimdzhanov, Szeged 1994 }
1... Rxe5 { The white queen is doubly pinned and is needed to protect g2. } 2. Qxh4 { 2.Qxe5  Qxg2#  ✔   or  2...Qxd3–+  And   2.Qxg6  Rxe1#  ✔   or  2...Nxg6–+ } 2... Rxe1+ { Or   2...Qxd3–+ } 3. Qxe1 Qxd3 { ✔ } *


